      "id": "claim_0c1a682818444f59916c6a05970d3833",
      "statement": "The app adapts layout by window width, not device type: below a 768pt breakpoint it uses a narrow bottom-tab + native-stack layout, at or above it a three-column SplitLayout (220pt sidebar, 340pt list, flexible detail); selection state (active destination + selected agent) is lifted into AppShell so it survives live resize across the breakpoint.",
