    {
      "id": "claim_9b14168b70534c198b5cae70d83526bb",
      "statement": "pairing.ts is pure QR payload parsing plus URL construction: parsePairingQRPayload validates the JSON shape (v, fp, hosts, port, secret) and throws a single unified NetworkError code pairing_qr_invalid for all problems to avoid leaking which field failed; pairingUrls emits one https://host:port/v1/pair URL per QR host (IPv6 bracketed) in payload order for host-fallback iteration.",
