    {
      "id": "claim_b1d914e370594e21925c63a6d2d7cbad",
      "statement": "withHostFallback tries candidate daemon addresses in order: connection-layer failures move to the next address (with a warn log), application-layer errors propagate immediately, and exhausting all candidates throws the last connection error (or no_address), because the multi-homed daemon's QR host ordering carries no reachability information.",
