      "id": "claim_015990ea02094fa1ad7862056c16e3d6",
      "statement": "Pairing credentials form a multi-instance model keyed by certificate fingerprint with an active-instance pointer; pure rules in paired-instances.ts (record validation, legacy migration merge, active resolution/fallback) while Keychain I/O and migration orchestration live in credentials.ts.",
