      "id": "claim_7349f07a21964215a69e3968f5fc5be1",
      "statement": "planSessionSet reconciles desired instances against existing sessions: new instance → start, removed → stop, same fingerprint with any changed credential field → stop and restart; sessions carry no active/inactive semantics — all sessions run in parallel and focus is only a UI rendering choice, so switching the active instance just moves the pointer and is instant.",
