      "statement": "planForegroundTransition maps app state changes to all-session actions (background → pause all, return to active → begin all + restart mDNS discovery, inactive → hold), while planSessionRetry restarts probes for sessions in not_found/failed phases with one mDNS kick and keeps backoff counts while any session is still discovering so the retry loop cannot pin backoff at its first step.",
