      "statement": "ConnectionProvider owns the single shared mDNS listener fanned out to all sessions, throttled retry timing, the active-instance pointer, and exposes per-instance status (instanceStates) plus unpair/switchInstance/forgetInstance to the UI; the UI's state always reflects the active instance's session.",
