      "id": "claim_01f1a73177a448cea6fbfe04d66c487e",
      "statement": "Forgetting an instance uses the DELETE /v1/device endpoint with classification-driven decisions: revoked (204) or already_invalid (401, server has no valid record) → delete local credentials silently; unreachable/other failures → keep local credentials and prompt the user; on re-pairing an existing fingerprint, the old token is revoked only after the new credentials are stored, and revocation failure never blocks pairing success.",
