      "statement": "Agent favorites are a client-only, per-instance ordered set of Agent source_ids persisted in MMKV: dangling favorites (source_id absent from a live snapshot) are pruned immediately because pane source_ids are never reused, but an empty snapshot (disconnect/loading) passes through untouched to avoid wiping all favorites; corrupted storage degrades silently to an empty set, and all UI shares the single isFavoriteSourceId predicate.",
